<title>GERMANY: GEA -1996 net profit slips to 105 mln dmk.</title>
<headline>GEA -1996 net profit slips to 105 mln dmk.</headline>
<dateline>DUESSELDORF, Germany 1997-03-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Calendar 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group net profit			   105     vs 110.7</p>
<p>    Group sales				  4,313   vs 4,053</p>
<p>    Incoming orders			    4,397   vs 4,102</p>
<p>    Workforce headcount (end Dec)	  17,150  vs 17,833</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German process technology supplier is GEA AG. The company had said in January that it expected 1996 net profit to fall just below 111 million marks.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom + 49 69 756525</p>
</text>
